GoBD validator and reader

What the MIT licence covers
---------------------------

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the source code, tests, build configuration and
specifications in this repository, and the parts of gobd-validate and gobd-reader built from
them.

What it does not cover
----------------------

The Beschreibungsstandard material published by Audicon GmbH.

  src/GoBd.Validation/Resources/gdpdu-01-03-2019.dtd, and the copy of it that gobd-validate and
  gobd-reader carry inside them, is Audicon's work. It is redistributed because the standard
  requires every data carrier to carry it alongside index.xml. It is not covered by the MIT
  licence.

  The specification document that accompanies it, and the archive it is published in, are not
  redistributed here at all. Both are published by Audicon/Caseware at
  https://www.caseware.com/de/beschreibungsstandard

The components of other projects that the builds contain. Each is named, with its licence, in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt, which gobd-validate prints with --notices and gobd-reader shows under
Help > Third-party notices.

